== Description ==
Increases the duration of Incantation spells and efficiency of Evocation spells.

Gains [[Experience#Pet Experience|experience]] every second depending on the amount of currently active spells.

This box synergizes very well with all classes using Evocation spells.

== Pet Abilities ==

Multiplies Evocation efficiency by:
<br><math>L^{1.06} \times P \times 0.73 + 1</math>

Multiplies Incantation duration by:
<br><math>log_{10}(L^{2} \times P) \times 0.025 + 1</math>


where:
* <math>L = \text{Pet Level}</math>
* <math>P = \text{Pet Ability Power}</math>

== Experience Gain ==
Gains experience each second, equal to:
<br><math>\left(S^2 \times 5 + F\right) \times M</math>

where:
* <math>S = \text{Active Spells}</math>
* <math>F = \text{Fixed Pet XP Bonus}</math>
* <math>M = \text{Pet XP Multiplier}</math>

